        "NF4 Aggressive Quantization\n\n• NF4 = 4-bit NormalFloat format\n• Better than INT4 for weights with normal distribution\n• Double quantization enabled for extra compression\n• Excludes embeddings and output layers (keep at higher precision)\n• Uses 512 calibration samples for quality\n• Expected size: ~12.5% of original (87.5% reduction)\n\nUse AWQ to protect salient weights!"
